  "description": "A truly open-source testing framework for Dynamics 365 / Power Platform that makes unit testing plugins, workflows, and custom code simple and fast.\n\n      This modernized version focuses exclusively on Dynamics 365 v9.x and later (Power Platform / Common Data Service).",
