  "published": "2026-06-19T04:51:46.6Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.2.0\n      - Added net10.0 cross-platform target (built against Microsoft.PowerPlatform.Dataverse.Client 1.2.10)\n      - Multi-targets net462;net10.0\n      - Upgraded FakeItEasy to 8.3.0\n      - net10 leg excludes FW-only workflow/CodeActivity simulation and live-connect (XrmRealContext)\n\n      Version 1.1.1\n      - Possibly breaking change - order of create no longer determines order of return\n      - ExecuteAsync request executor with asyncoperation tracking\n      - MetadataGenerator public API (FromEarlyBoundEntity, CreateAttributeMetadataByType)\n      - PicklistAttributeMetadata OptionSet population from context\n      - ExecuteMultiple ContinueOnError fix and fault extraction\n      - Composite alternate key uniqueness enforcement\n      - RowVersion / optimistic concurrency support\n      - Alternate keys in Associate/Disassociate requests\n      - Fiscal period operators (InFiscalPeriod, ThisFiscalPeriod, etc.)\n      - LIKE wildcards with character ranges [A-Z], sets [abc], negation [^abc]\n      - DateTime.Kind handling for DateOnly/TimeZoneIndependent fields\n      - Min date validation (01/01/1753)\n      - CreateEntityRequest executor for entity metadata creation\n      - UpdateEntityRequest executor for entity metadata updates\n      - DeleteEntityRequest executor for entity metadata deletion\n      - SDK message coverage: 29/61 (48%)\n\n      Version 1.0.1 - CalculateRollupFieldRequest Support\n      - Added CalculateRollupFieldRequestExecutor for testing rollup field calculations\n\n      Version 1.0.0 - DataverseFakes.Community Initial Release\n      - Truly open-source and community-driven fork\n      - Focus exclusively on D365 v9.x and later (Power Platform / Dataverse)\n      - Removed support for legacy CRM versions (2011-2016)",
